WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:04.558
Unit four. Environmental Awareness!

2
00:00:05.559 --> 00:00:14.220
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Pre-Intermediate level!

3
00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:18.602
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:18.652 --> 00:00:23.443
Today we learn: Environmental Awareness. Let's go!

5
00:00:24.508 --> 00:00:28.208
Pollution. Say it with me. Pollution!

6
00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:35.504
Recycle. Say it with me. Recycle!

7
00:00:38.959 --> 00:00:43.092
Sustainable. Say it with me. Sustainable!

8
00:00:46.593 --> 00:00:50.776
Conservation. Say it with me. Conservation!

9
00:00:54.284 --> 00:00:58.317
Renewable. Say it with me. Renewable!

10
00:01:01.882 --> 00:01:06.148
Ecosystem. Say it with me. Ecosystem!

11
00:01:09.586 --> 00:01:13.269
Impact. Say it with me. Impact!

12
00:01:16.741 --> 00:01:20.324
Preserve. Say it with me. Preserve!

13
00:01:23.836 --> 00:01:27.919
Wildlife. Say it with me. Wildlife!

14
00:01:31.402 --> 00:01:35.802
Climate change. Say it with me. Climate change!

15
00:01:39.329 --> 00:01:49.588
Grammar time! should / could for suggestions. Listen. We should recycle more. We could use renewable energy.

16
00:01:49.638 --> 00:01:56.060
Your turn. Say it with me. We should recycle more. We could use renewable energy.

17
00:02:01.438 --> 00:02:11.951
Pollution harms our ecosystem, so we should recycle and choose sustainable, renewable options. Conservation helps preserve our impact on the planet.

18
00:02:12.001 --> 00:02:13.558
I like this story!

19
00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:19.748
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:19.798 --> 00:02:21.027
Sustainable!

21
00:02:22.227 --> 00:02:27.574
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:27.624 --> 00:02:28.774
Impact!

23
00:02:29.823 --> 00:02:38.697
Think and answer. What can individuals do to help the environment?

24
00:02:38.747 --> 00:02:39.937
Great answer!

25
00:02:41.064 --> 00:02:45.560
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.206
Goodbye, everyone!

